{"abstract":"This study performed tungsten (W) co-deposition experiments using pulsed laser deposition under exposure to helium/argon plasma in a linear plasma device. Micron-sized spherical W particles formed under co-deposition conditions. It was suggested that these particles grew from nanoparticles via the electrostatic collection of W ions in the plasma plume before deposition.","affiliations":[],"arxiv_id":"2510.15641","authors":["S. Kodate","Y. Hayashi","S. Kajita"],"availability":{"basis":"arxiv_public_full_text","checked_at":"2026-08-19T17:09:10+00:00","full_text_url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2510.15641.pdf","license":"arxiv-distribution","page_count":4,"pdf_bytes":2386411,"status":"available"},"citation_count":null,"content_digest":"bb12819c023abd78b27fea920ceabd267298bf470b2822fcd5d57bc7b478922e","created_at":"2026-08-19T17:09:10+00:00","doi":"","identifier_observations":[],"institutions":[],"landing_url":"","legacy_ids":[],"migration_provenance":{"source_content_digest":"42235c858df56b039ab6e74ca2cbcc91f71aa4f0131ce6763c1ba95a7a7b924b","source_schema_version":"global-work-v1"},"openalex_id":"","pmcid":"","pmid":"","publication_date":"","revision":1,"schema_version":"global-work-v2","semantic_scholar_id":"","source_urls":[],"status":"active","title":"Formation of a Tungsten Co-deposition Layer with Microparticles Using Pulsed Laser Deposition","updated_at":"2026-08-19T17:09:10+00:00","venue":"arXiv","work_id":"W-3E45F7C34FD0","year":2025}
{"abstract":"Factored decentralized Markov decision process (Dec-MDP) is a framework for modeling sequential decision making problems in multi-agent systems. In this paper, we formalize the learning of numerical methods for hyperbolic partial differential equations (PDEs), specifically the Weighted Essentially Non-Oscillatory (WENO) scheme, as a factored Dec-MDP problem. We show that different reward formulations lead to either reinforcement learning (RL) or behavior cloning, and a homogeneous policy could be learned for all agents under the RL formulation with a policy gradient algorithm. Because the trained agents only act on their local observations, the multi-agent system can be used as a general numerical method for hyperbolic PDEs and generalize to different spatial discretizations, episode lengths, dimensions, and even equation types.","affiliations":[],"arxiv_id":"2205.15716","authors":["Yiwei Fu","Dheeraj S. K. Kapilavai","Elliot Way"],"availability":{"basis":"arxiv_public_full_text","checked_at":"2026-08-14T04:41:08+00:00","full_text_url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2205.15716.pdf","license":"arxiv-distribution","page_count":13,"pdf_bytes":614594,"status":"available"},"citation_count":null,"content_digest":"385ad0e5180346fefa78e786478c4342cb79ccc52bcae503bdd34223c7b62f7f","created_at":"2026-08-14T04:41:08+00:00","doi":"","identifier_observations":[],"institutions":[],"landing_url":"","legacy_ids":[],"migration_provenance":{"source_content_digest":"b0323c993a63fd20a9f2dfe9022f864a4a70b0f0aec211cf2c1d6a14ca6aab67","source_schema_version":"global-work-v1"},"openalex_id":"","pmcid":"","pmid":"","publication_date":"","revision":1,"schema_version":"global-work-v2","semantic_scholar_id":"","source_urls":[],"status":"active","title":"Multi-Agent Learning of Numerical Methods for Hyperbolic PDEs with Factored Dec-MDP","updated_at":"2026-08-14T04:41:08+00:00","venue":"arXiv","work_id":"W-9B107362FBE9","year":2022}
